ion":["Kargo Korumas\u0131"],"Enable Shipping Protection":["Kargo Korumas\u0131n\u0131 Etkinle\u015ftir"],"Allow customers to add shipping protection to their order.":["M\u00fc\u015fterilerin sipari\u015flerine kargo korumas\u0131 eklemelerine izin verin."],"Description":["A\u00e7\u0131klama"],"Protect your order from damage or loss":["Sipari\u015finizi hasara veya kaybolmaya kar\u015f\u0131 koruyun"],"Price":["Fiyat"],"Show Icon":["Simgeyi G\u00f6ster"],"Display an icon next to the add-on in the cart drawer.":["Sepet \u00e7ekmecesindeki eklentinin yan\u0131nda bir simge g\u00f6sterin."],"Default State":["Varsay\u0131lan Durum"],"Whether the add-on is toggled on or off by default for new visitors.":["Yeni ziyaret\u00e7iler i\u00e7in eklentinin varsay\u0131lan olarak a\u00e7\u0131k m\u0131 yoksa kapal\u0131 m\u0131 olaca\u011f\u0131."],"Off (customer opts in)":["Kapal\u0131 (m\u00fc\u015fteri dahil olur)"],"On (customer opts out)":["A\u00e7\u0131k (m\u00fc\u015fteri devre d\u0131\u015f\u0131 b\u0131rak\u0131r)"],"WooCommerce minimum":["WooCommerce minimum"],"Free shipping comes from WooCommerce, not from this meter. Add a Free shipping method with a minimum order amount to your shipping zones in WooCommerce \u2192 Settings \u2192 Shipping. The meter only shows when the shopper\u2019s zone has one.":["\u00dccretsiz kargo bu \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcden de\u011fil, WooCommerce'den gelir. WooCommerce \u2192 Ayarlar \u2192 Kargo'da kargo b\u00f6lgelerinize minimum sipari\u015f tutar\u0131 olan bir \u00dccretsiz kargo y\u00f6ntemi ekleyin. \u00d6l\u00e7\u00fc yaln\u0131zca al\u0131\u015fveri\u015f yapan\u0131n b\u00f6lgesinde bir tane oldu\u011funda g\u00f6sterilir."],"Higher free shipping goal (optional)":["Daha y\u00fcksek \u00fccretsiz kargo hedefi (iste\u011fe ba\u011fl\u0131)"],"Leave at 0 to use the minimum order amount from WooCommerce. A higher amount only raises the goal shown in the meter. It does not give free shipping by itself, and amounts below the WooCommerce minimum are ignored.":["WooCommerce minimumunu kullanmak i\u00e7in 0'da b\u0131rak\u0131n. Daha y\u00fcksek bir tutar yaln\u0131zca \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcde g\u00f6sterilen hedefi y\u00fckseltir. Kendi ba\u015f\u0131na \u00fccretsiz kargo sa\u011flamaz ve WooCommerce minimumunun alt\u0131ndaki tutarlar yoksay\u0131l\u0131r."]}}}